DECL	{"assumptions":[],"binders":["x"],"id":"NRS_484D_100_1","intentions":[],"laws":["NRS-484D-100-1"],"narrowings":[{"kind":"no_atom","span":"f7","why":"'When directed by an official traffic control device' to display lighted lamps: no atom of the surface denotes such a direction. dev.regulatory_sign carries no code that directs lamps to be displayed (its codes are no_left_turn … no_trucks), dev.zone_sign no such kind, and dev.governs / rel.occupies / st.travel_region only locate a device; written with them the limb would be a device's presence, not its direction. The plan's gap (dev.lamp_use_sign) is the atom needed."}],"operationalizations":[],"residues":[],"surrogate":false}
